Delta Lake.snippet:
MERGE INTO target t USING source s ON t.id = s.id
WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE SET *
WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT *;

Dead Letter Queue (DLQ).snippet:
try:
    process(record)
except BadRecord as e:
    dlq.send(record, error=str(e))

